# 🧪 Test Rules

- 📝 Every single code change requires accompanying tests under `tests/`.
- 💯 `npm test` must pass flawlessly (100%) before task completion.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Post-Prompt Trigger**: After your prompt response is complete, ALWAYS review and update corresponding architecture documentation and tests.
